NOTICE

The data in this repository are individual-level anonymized survey responses
collected across three waves of a cross-national conjoint survey experiment.
All responses have been anonymized prior to inclusion. Users must not attempt
to re-identify respondents. Use of the data is expected to comply with the
ethical conditions under which it was originally collected.

This dataset reprocesses and extends data from published replication archives.
Please see the README for details on the source data, discrepancies with
prior archives, and how to cite this dataset.
